[0.418,"o","\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 41 +\u001b[38;5;231m## Line clarity                                                          \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 42 +\u001b[38;5;231m                                                                         \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 43 +\u001b[38;5;231m`invoicer review` asks the model whether each line says clearly enough wh\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m    +\u001b[38;5;231mat we delivered. It prints the lines that                                \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m 44 +\u001b[38;5;231mdon't, with the reason, and exits 1 when it finds one. `src/review/` hold\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m    +\u001b[38;5;231ms the prompt and the request.                                            \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m 45 +\u001b[38;5;231m                                                                         \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m 46 +\u001b[38;5;231mMaria in accounting graded last quarter's lines clear or vague, with her \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m    +\u001b[38;5;231mreason, in `evals/line-clarity.jsonl`.                                   \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m47\u001b[11G\u001b[38;5;231m`npm run score:\u001b[27Geview` runs every graded l\u001b[55Ge\u001b[57Gthr\u001b[61Ge times\u001b[69Gagainst the r\u001b[83Ga\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bl model and writes the share of her vague\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m48\u001b[11G\u001b[38;5;231mlines the check\u001b[27Gcatches\u001b[35Gand\u001b[39Gthe\u001b[43Gshare\u001b[49Gof\u001b[52Gher\u001b[56Gclear\u001b[62Glines\u001b[68Git\u001b[71Gpasses,\u001b[79Geach\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m    +\u001b[38;5;231mapart, to `evals/scores/review.json`.                                    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m 49 +\u001b[38;5;231mThe step in CI that runs `invoicer review` on `invoices/` reads that scor\r